    "updated_at": "2023-01-13T02:36:20Z",
    "body": "`beforeunload` is triggered for all navigations, at step https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#beginning-navigation:checking-if-unloading-is-user-canceled . It's done immediately, before the browser knows whether or not a navigation will actually result in unloading.\r\n\r\nIt's `unload` that only gets triggered on actual-unloading.\r\n\r\nSo Chromium's behavior is correct.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
