    "body": "See https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#navigable for the definition of navigable; I don't think you're using it correctly.\r\n\r\nIndeed, all links go through the navigate algorithm. See https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#following-hyperlinks-2 step 13.",
